  "description": "<p data-start=\"186\" data-end=\"535\">Duik in de explosieve strijd van <strong data-start=\"219\" data-end=\"255\">Call of Duty: Modern Warfare III</strong>, het vervolg op Modern Warfare II. Met een intense campaign, vernieuwde multiplayer en een open-world Zombies-modus biedt deze game eindeloze actie. Op de PS5 profiteer je van verbeterde graphics, razendsnelle laadtijden en haptische feedback voor een nog meeslependere ervaring.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"693\">Dit exemplaar verkeert <strong data-start=\"560\" data-end=\"578\">In Nette Staat</strong>, is volledig getest en <strong data-start=\"602\" data-end=\"622\">100% functioneel</strong>.<br data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"626\"><em data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"693\">(Laat weten of het een losse disc of complete set met hoesje is.)</em></p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"712\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"1025\">\r\n<li data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"771\">\r\n<p data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"771\">🔫 Explosieve <strong data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"741\">campaign</strong> met cinematografische actie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"772\" data-end=\"834\">\r\n<p data-start=\"774\" data-end=\"834\">🎮 Vernieuwde <strong data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"803\">multiplayer</strong> met klassieke en nieuwe maps</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"835\" data-end=\"896\">\r\n<p data-start=\"837\" data-end=\"896\">🧟 <strong data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"862\">Open-World Zombies</strong> – voor het eerst in de MW-serie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"958\">\r\n<p data-start=\"899\" data-end=\"958\">⚡ PS5-upgrades: 4K, 60–120FPS, haptic triggers & 3D Audio</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"1025\">\r\n<p data-start=\"961\" data-end=\"1025\">👥 Rijk aan content, perfect voor zowel solo spelers als teams</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1027\" data-end=\"1049\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1380\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1097\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1097\"><strong data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1062\">Titel:</strong> Call of Duty: Modern Warfare III</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1098\" data-end=\"1129\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1129\"><strong data-start=\"1100\" data-end=\"1113\">Platform:</strong> PlayStation 5</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1159\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1159\"><strong data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1142\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1190\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1190\"><strong data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1172\">Genre:</strong> Shooter / Actie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1252\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1252\"><strong data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1205\">Spelers:</strong> Singleplayer • Multiplayer • Co-op • Zombies</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1351\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1275\"><strong data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1273\">Verbeteringen:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1351\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1301\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1280\" data-end=\"1301\">4K resolutie-opties</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1304\" data-end=\"1326\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1326\">Haptische feedback</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1351\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1331\" data-end=\"1351\">Snelle SSD-loading</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1380\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1380\"><strong data-start=\"1354\" data-end=\"1374\">Compatibiliteit:</strong> PS5</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1415\"><strong data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1405\">Incl. Garantie:</strong> 1 maand</h3>",
